{"strongs": "H4471", "word": "מַמְרֵא", "translit": "mam.re", "root": "ממרא", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Mamre", "definition": "מַמְרֵא proper name, masculine and of a location Mamre , only in Genesis: 1. in J only אֵלֹנֵי מַמְרֵא terebinths of Mamre (proper name, masculine?), Gen 13:18 (defined by אֲשֶׁר בְּחֶבְרוֺן ), Gen 18:1 (in both the dwelling-place of Abraham). 2. proper name, masculine in Gen 14:13 ( הָאֱמֹרִי ׳ אֵלֹנֵי מ ), compare v Gen 14:24 (where ally of Abraham) 3. proper name, of a location in P : near Abraham's place of burial Gen 23:17 ; Gen 25:9 ; Gen 49:30 ; Gen 50:3 apparently identified with Hebron Gen 23:19 ; Gen 35:27 , compare Di . — ᵐ5 Μαμβρη . מִמְשַׁח see משׁח . מִמְשָׁל , מֶמְשָׁלָה , מֶמְשֶׁ֫לֶת see משׁל [ מִמְשָׁק ] see משׁק . מַמְתַֿקִּים see מתק .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4705')\">BDB4705</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4471')\">H4471</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4704')\">BDB4704</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4706')\">BDB4706</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַמְרֵא</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> and <b>of a location</b> <highlightword>Mamre</highlightword>, only in Genesis: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> only <bdbheb>אֵלֹנֵי מַמְרֵא</bdbheb> <highlight>terebinths of Mamre</highlight> (proper name, masculine?), <ref ref=\"Gen 13:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,18)\">Gen 13:18</ref> (defined by <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר בְּחֶבְרוֺן</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Gen 18:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,1)\">Gen 18:1</ref> (in both the dwelling-place of Abraham). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. proper name, masculine</b> in <ref ref=\"Gen 14:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,13)\">Gen 14:13</ref> (<bdbheb>הָאֱמֹרִי</bdbheb